  "notes": "A formal word used mainly in legislative, judicial, and administrative contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {審議|しんぎ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to deliberate\n- {審議|しんぎ}⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{入|はい}る→入る：00494_hairu⟧: to enter deliberation\n- {審議|しんぎ}⟦{中|ちゅう}→〜中：09840_chuu⟧: under deliberation\n- {審議|しんぎ}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{尽|つ}くす→尽くす：02077_tsukusu⟧: to deliberate thoroughly\n- {審議|しんぎ}{会|かい}: deliberation council\n\nWATCH OUT:\n⟦{真偽|しんぎ}→真偽：05564_shingi⟧ (truth or falsehood) is pronounced the same but has a completely different meaning.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {審議|しんぎ}: formal deliberation (legislature, committee)\n- ⟦{議論|ぎろん}→議論：02650_giron⟧: discussion, debate (general)\n- ⟦{検討|けんとう}→検討：02710_kentou⟧: examination, consideration (less formal)",
